fects and cmd.\n\nThings a reviewer should know:\n- **Auth header:** `jobpod` doesn't define one, so `job-post` expects `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. The #317 client has to send the same.\n- **Orphan reaping:** it runs only on Linux and only when job-exec is PID 1, so the unit tests can't cover it. The kind-based test in #321 is the real check.\n- **Container restart:** `job-exec` fails if `/job/home/.claude` already exists, so the pod should not restart that container.\n- **Checked on Linux, not Windows:** the Linux build of `jobexec` passed `go vet`. The non-unix build was not vetted, because `GOOS=windows go vet` stopped on a dependency download.\n\nThe report is at `.ard/316/worker-engineer.md`.","ttft_ms":1010,"type":"result","duration_ms":461241,"uuid":"0d14738e-845c-411a-a340-ea6883f62865","ttft_stream_ms":652,"time_to_request_ms":31,"first_content_frame_ms":653,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":66,"outputTokens":41979,"cacheReadInputTokens":1788081,"cacheCreationInputTokens":77076,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9070341000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":7695,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":77076,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
